{"ID":"20240220132609-9hqkhq0","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132609-9hqkhq0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132609-9hqkhq0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170842-82k3b9x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170828-8w5dxce\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:267,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312170948-zr1r9ly\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:73,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:73\u0026#125;","title":"【吴茱萸汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312170842-82k3b9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-82k3b9x","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十三条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170842-sxbx8z3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-sxbx8z3","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：【少阴病】，吐剧。手足厥冷，烦燥欲死者，【吴茱萸汤】主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170842-ijdiz2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-ijdiz2t","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经方里，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜也可以止呕，半夏也可以止呕，干姜也可以止呕，吴茱萸也可以止呕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。吴茱萸是用在阴症的时候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手脚温度体现胃气的强弱，吐的厉害的时候，手足冰冷，用吴茱萸来治。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170842-c36d23j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-c36d23j","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170842-6foc9mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-6foc9mq","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸一升\t人参二两\t生姜六两（切）\t大枣十二枚（劈）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170842-lv2idmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-lv2idmv","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水七升，煮取二升，去滓，温服七合，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170842-41c8vff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-41c8vff","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吴茱萸汤有：吴茱萸一升洗。人参三两。生姜六两切。大枣十二枚劈。人参吐很严重，胃津液伤到了。生姜能够把胃里面的水散掉，吴茱萸能够止呕，止恶心。人参生姜红枣是滋阴的药，吴茱萸是主力治疗恶心呕吐的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170842-xg06wh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170842-xg06wh0","updated":"20240312170842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在阴症的时候，出现恶心会使用吴茱萸，如果是阳症，胃里面停水很多，恶心会用到生半夏。或者干姜也可以止呕，温中。生半夏能够去胃周围的水，都可以止恶心。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170843-edrvzi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170843-edrvzi5"}},{"ID":"20240312170912-96wmoow","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-96wmoow","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百五十八条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-ymovhnr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-ymovhnr","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：食谷欲呕者，属「阳明」也，「吴茱萸汤」主之。得汤反剧者，属上焦。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-t41m1rr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-t41m1rr","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「吴茱萸汤」实际上是胃虚的时候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"朝食暮吐，有两种，一种是实症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胃里面有坏死的食物堵到，大黄甘草汤。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有一种是虚症，虚症的时候吴茱萸汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，胃虚掉了，吃东西不消化，用吴茱萸汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-wcrngtt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-wcrngtt","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"湿热的时候大黄甘草汤，比例是大黄是二，甘草是一。大黄甘草汤可以用粉剂，一般来说大黄的三分之二钱，甘草的三分之一钱，加起来是一钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-h0xxxrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-h0xxxrz","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-uajmiwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-uajmiwh","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸一升洗。人参三两。生姜六两切。大枣十二枚劈。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-zfpkcpd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-zfpkcpd","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水七升，煮取二升，去滓，温服七合，日三服。吴茱萸用三钱，重证的时候可以用到五钱，人参、生姜、大枣酌量的用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-4fbo69z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-4fbo69z","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个是吴茱萸汤，会用到人参、生姜、红枣，这个是虚症。实症的时候我们不会用到这些药味，实症我们要攻下了，我们不会去补它了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-ov60eos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-ov60eos","updated":"20240312170912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床上病人说很恶心，恶心两种处方，一种半夏是止恶心的。吴茱萸也可以止呕。两个差异在哪里？半夏是水饮造成的，病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有渴就不可以用半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。有渴恶心，我们用吴茱萸或者是生姜。如果病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不渴，代表胃里面有积水，这个是水饮造成的恶心，这个时候要用半夏"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。水饮的脉，关脉非常的弦细。弦细的脉就代表水饮的脉。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-m6yiylo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-m6yiylo"}},{"ID":"20240312170948-5p6kmdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-5p6kmdb","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十三条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-n1jhx3b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-n1jhx3b","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：【少阴病】，吐剧。手足厥冷，烦燥欲死者，【吴茱萸汤】主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-c98l84y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-c98l84y","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"经方里，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生姜也可以止呕，半夏也可以止呕，干姜也可以止呕，吴茱萸也可以止呕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。吴茱萸是用在阴症的时候。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"手脚温度体现胃气的强弱，吐的厉害的时候，手足冰冷，用吴茱萸来治。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-1vpk316","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-1vpk316","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-rr9vmct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-rr9vmct","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸一升\t人参二两\t生姜六两（切）\t大枣十二枚（劈）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-p7yc45i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-p7yc45i","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右四味，以水七升，煮取二升，去滓，温服七合，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-u80cczw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-u80cczw","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吴茱萸汤有：吴茱萸一升洗。人参三两。生姜六两切。大枣十二枚劈。人参吐很严重，胃津液伤到了。生姜能够把胃里面的水散掉，吴茱萸能够止呕，止恶心。人参生姜红枣是滋阴的药，吴茱萸是主力治疗恶心呕吐的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170948-zr1r9ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170948-zr1r9ly","updated":"20240312170948"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在阴症的时候，出现恶心会使用吴茱萸，如果是阳症，胃里面停水很多，恶心会用到生半夏。或者干姜也可以止呕，温中。生半夏能够去胃周围的水，都可以止恶心。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170912-wzt34vy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170912-wzt34vy"}},{"ID":"20240312170828-exeqmst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170828-exeqmst","updated":"20240312170828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百九十四条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170828-5o5dgd2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170828-5o5dgd2","updated":"20240312170828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：干呕，吐涎沬，头痛者，「吴茱荚汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170828-1rgoi78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170828-1rgoi78","updated":"20240312170828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在肝病的时候，胃下垂的时候，都会有恶心干呕。干呕并不是说吃坏肚子吐出来，而是胃里面恶心，吃不下东西。代表胃没有问题，是别的东西影响到胃。吴茱萸汤很好用。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170828-c68mhln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170828-c68mhln","updated":"20240312170828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么会头痛？吴茱萸汤是很热的药。肝肿起来顶到胃，顶到胃，胃的容积变小了，蠕动也变缓了，胃家变寒症，胃本来没有寒，可是因为肝脏问题影响到胃。胃气往上逆的时候，出现头痛症状。"}]},{"ID":"20240312170828-8w5dxce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312170828-8w5dxce","updated":"20240312170828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吴茱萸的头痛出现，一定在印堂痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}